With Weather Forecast, it's easier than ever to plan your daily activities: just choose the weather parameters you want to track, choose the layout you like, and view the customized weather forecast! Enjoy the amazing weather background to make the weather forecast as intuitive as nature.

INSIGHTFUL DETAILS
- Today's Min, Max and "Feels Like" temperature;
- Pressure in inches, mm, kPa or mbar;
- Precipitation and humidity info;
- Wind speed and direction;
- Sunrise/Sunset and Moonrise/Moonset time;
- Golden hour and Blue hour;

SIMPLICITY OF USE
- 14-day hourly forecast;
- Air Quality;
- RainScope;
